          <li>Plotly mood timeline chart</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card" style="margin-top:.8rem">
      <h3>5. Human Support Connection 🆘</h3>
      <p>5 Indian helplines + 5 international lines displayed immediately on HIGH/CRITICAL. Stanley-Brown Safety Plan template. Optional Twilio SMS alert (consent-gated).</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  
  <div class="section">
    <h2>🎯 Risk Classification Engine</h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th>Level</th><th>Threshold</th><th>Categories</th><th>Agent Action</th></tr>
      <tr><td><span class="pill p-none">NONE</span></td><td>&lt; 0.20</td><td>—</td><td>Standard supportive response</td></tr>
      <tr><td><span class="pill p-low">LOW</span></td><td>0.20–0.44</td><td>mild_distress</td><td>Warm acknowledgment + resources</td></tr>
      <tr><td><span class="pill p-med">MEDIUM</span></td><td>0.45–0.74</td><td>moderate/severe depression</td><td>Extra empathy + professional referral</td></tr>
      <tr><td><span class="pill p-high">HIGH</span></td><td>0.75–0.99</td><td>self_harm, severe</td><td>Crisis resources + safety check</td></tr>
      <tr><td><span class="pill p-crit">CRITICAL</span></td><td>1.0</td><td>suicidal_ideation, crisis_signals</td><td>Immediate helplines + emergency services</td></tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  
